{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 120,
    "dDurationMs": 4670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let's have a face-off of the most burly olympic\nhurling events - the Hammer throw, Javelin,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4790,
    "dDurationMs": 1201,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Discus, and Shot Put."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5991,
    "dDurationMs": 4449,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The Hammer and the Shot each weigh 16 pounds,\nwhich is two or three babies-worth of iron"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 10440,
    "dDurationMs": 3170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "either swung around at the end of a chain\nor hurled with brute strength."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 13610,
    "dDurationMs": 4330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The discus, as you may know, is basically\na four-pound frisbee, and the javelin is,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 17940,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "well, a javelin."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 19500,
    "dDurationMs": 3940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, Olympians can toss all of these things\npretty far - I mean, in the 1980s they had"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 23440,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to redesign the javelin to make it harder\nto throw, because athletes were starting to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 26920,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "lob it farther than the entire length of a\nstadium and into the stands…"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 30840,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It still has the longest world record, but\nthe javelin is considerably lighter than the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 34320,
    "dDurationMs": 4650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "other implements, so which one – the hammer,\njavelin, discus, or shot – gets thrown with"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 38970,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the most energy?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 40050,
    "dDurationMs": 3719,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ignoring trivial things like air resistance\nand lift, we can figure out roughly how much"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 43769,
    "dDurationMs": 4321,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "energy each implement has just by knowing\nits weight and how far it gets thrown."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 48090,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So in fourth place, a javelin thrown the world-record\ndistance has enough energy to power a 50W"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 52170,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "light bulb for eight seconds."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 53670,
    "dDurationMs": 4770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In third is the discus, powering a lightbulb\nfor fifteen seconds, and squeezing into second"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 58440,
    "dDurationMs": 3101,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with one more second of illumination is the\nshot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 61541,
    "dDurationMs": 3579,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the gold medal goes by far to the hammer\nthrow, hurled with enough energy to power"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 65120,
    "dDurationMs": 1750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a lightbulb for a full minute!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 66870,
    "dDurationMs": 1679,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now that's hammering the competition."
    } ]
  } ]
}
